  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/57/logo.png\" width=\"825\" height=\"464\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款具有日本特色的模組，主要特色如下：<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a-qnA3XT5rc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J7xjqQXp/japaneseculture-barriers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"45\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>日本紫藤（藤）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">全新生物群系「日本紫藤公園」，懸崖上生長著巨大的紫藤花樹。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/59/2023-09-07_17.png\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>狸貓（たぬき）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">全新的動物生物，就是狸貓！（又稱狗狸子），一種棲息於森林、櫻花林與日本紫藤公園的生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/61/2023-09-07_17.png\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\">惡鬼（鬼）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">源自日本神話的怪物，共有四種變體。目前暫無自然生成設定。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/90/2023-09-07_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"405\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J7xjqQXp/japaneseculture-barriers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"45\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>",
